        "created_at": "2014-03-14T21:21:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, yeah, but Drawn to the Flame is so much fun against them!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\">  (Yes, I know X will always =0, but with nemesis bonus, it's basically the same as Tempest's base power, then Imbue Fire, then Staff, then any other bonuses… It adds up <em>so</em> fast!)</p>",
