        "created_at": "2014-03-14T21:54:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haha yeah, Scorched Earth followed by Drawn to the Flame's power in the same turn (even if there are no villain ongoings or environment cards out) when Ra has numerous damage bonuses is always fun :D. Must bear that in mind next time I'm fighting the Chairman alongside Legacy in a busy environment...</p>",
