        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T00:17:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, bringing a single-target damage dealer against The Ennead is asking for trouble. &nbsp;Brings tanks, control, and global damage - that makes them cry.</p><p>Don't feel too bad for Haka, though - it's not like bringing Unity against Iron Legacy or anything. &nbsp;It's just not optimal.</p>",
